{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each run in <strong>Fugue Shot</strong> presents a dreamscape filled with difficult encounters, puzzles, and challenges. Face the Omens and collect synergistic items to shift the dreamscape and your playstyle. Can you overcome the unstable terrain of this liminal world, or will you be consumed by it?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3538440/extras/b898cd8f2e820200d94f7734e42a9f4c.poster.avif?t=1773037553\" width=616 height=128 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3538440/extras/b898cd8f2e820200d94f7734e42a9f4c.webm?t=1773037553\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3538440/extras/b898cd8f2e820200d94f7734e42a9f4c.mp4?t=1773037553\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Take On Multiple Gameplay Styles</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face a lineup of <strong>over 8 distinct Omens</strong> - each presenting the player with a new arcade gameplay style. Every Omen demands its own strategy, from fast-paced combat and frantic reaction tests to physics puzzles and exploratory trials. As you progress, the Omens evolve, growing in complexity and intensity as they drag you deeper into the dream.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3538440/extras/18359ea02ab08599979cc99b5b72adbb.poster.avif?t=1773037553\" width=616 height=122 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3538440/extras/18359ea02ab08599979cc99b5b72adbb.webm?t=1773037553\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3538440/extras/18359ea02ab08599979cc99b5b72adbb.mp4?t=1773037553\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Power Up Your Run</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Obtain any of <strong>over 150 unique Memories</strong> to warp your playstyle and bend the dream to your will.\u00a0Discover powerful synergies and modifiers to create truly unique builds, allowing for emergent gameplay and a constantly changing experience. Fill out entries in your Dream Journal to chart the dreamscape for future runs, and chip away at <strong>over 80\u00a0permanent unlocks</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3538440/extras/b86e06629a0a41c46d1c1d2e3adf6f8d.poster.avif?t=1773037553\" width=616 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3538440/extras/b86e06629a0a41c46d1c1d2e3adf6f8d.webm?t=1773037553\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3538440/extras/b86e06629a0a41c46d1c1d2e3adf6f8d.mp4?t=1773037553\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>An Eerily Beautiful World</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stunning and stylish pixel art compliments a hypnotic and meditative soundtrack to create a surreal, dreamy atmosphere. The world of <strong>Fugue Shot</strong> is a vivid dream designed  to get lost in.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3538440?t=1773037553","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3538440/b885eb17eba25c4552fa5e28307b37c37dc15eba/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1773037553","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3538440/be7ed8bc433b3f1766bc6294a39c706b4141e23f/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1773037553